    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/2484a9df9727ae829dbfab67fe5d1065.avif?t=1755636593\" width=616 height=110 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/a6aabfea683952d774752f89a377b86e.poster.avif?t=1755636593\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/a6aabfea683952d774752f89a377b86e.webm?t=1755636593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/a6aabfea683952d774752f89a377b86e.mp4?t=1755636593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Merge identical pieces to create higher-rank units \u2014\u00a0Pawn into Knight, Knight into Bishop, and so on\u00a0\u2014 unlocking new tactical powers with every fusion. Chain merges to reshape the board and crush each puzzle.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/796f8c64e871fedb6910f1d58e416ef6.avif?t=1755636593\" width=616 height=110 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/4adc8f351bc29947b510f5a0773d069e.poster.avif?t=1755636593\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/4adc8f351bc29947b510f5a0773d069e.webm?t=1755636593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/4adc8f351bc29947b510f5a0773d069e.mp4?t=1755636593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As water deepens and poison gas creeps across the board, dash to safety before it\u2019s too late. Outsmart hazards by timing your moves and using each turn to secure the advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/8d6696ed4f689056f128762ca975384d.avif?t=1755636593\" width=616 height=110 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/30f0013ffb8c12b3a7aa454630c82cb0.poster.avif?t=1755636593\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/30f0013ffb8c12b3a7aa454630c82cb0.webm?t=1755636593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/30f0013ffb8c12b3a7aa454630c82cb0.mp4?t=1755636593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Face the giant octopus boss in the ultimate showdown \u2014 jump your pieces onto bombs to detonate them and deal massive damage. Chase down the Dark Knight, leap through portals, and face a brand-new strategic test each time.    </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/2484a9df9727ae829dbfab67fe5d1065.avif?t=1755636593\" width=616 height=110 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/a6aabfea683952d774752f89a377b86e.poster.avif?t=1755636593\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/a6aabfea683952d774752f89a377b86e.webm?t=1755636593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/a6aabfea683952d774752f89a377b86e.mp4?t=1755636593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Merge identical pieces to create higher-rank units \u2014\u00a0Pawn into Knight, Knight into Bishop, and so on\u00a0\u2014 unlocking new tactical powers with every fusion. Chain merges to reshape the board and crush each puzzle.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/796f8c64e871fedb6910f1d58e416ef6.avif?t=1755636593\" width=616 height=110 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/4adc8f351bc29947b510f5a0773d069e.poster.avif?t=1755636593\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/4adc8f351bc29947b510f5a0773d069e.webm?t=1755636593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/4adc8f351bc29947b510f5a0773d069e.mp4?t=1755636593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As water deepens and poison gas creeps across the board, dash to safety before it\u2019s too late. Outsmart hazards by timing your moves and using each turn to secure the advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/8d6696ed4f689056f128762ca975384d.avif?t=1755636593\" width=616 height=110 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/30f0013ffb8c12b3a7aa454630c82cb0.poster.avif?t=1755636593\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/30f0013ffb8c12b3a7aa454630c82cb0.webm?t=1755636593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835520/extras/30f0013ffb8c12b3a7aa454630c82cb0.mp4?t=1755636593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Face the giant octopus boss in the ultimate showdown \u2014 jump your pieces onto bombs to detonate them and deal massive damage. Chase down the Dark Knight, leap through portals, and face a brand-new strategic test each time.    </p>",
    "short_description": "Chess 2048 \u2013 Classic chess moves meet fresh puzzle-strategy twists: watch the board reshape, adapt on the fly, and master piece combos. Then escape poison gas, jump between water tiles, use portals, and pull off clever tricks.",
